# RemoveObstacle - remove an auto-tracked keepout (source == SOURCE_TRACKER)
# from the mowing map without touching manual / imported keepouts, pending dig
# proposals or navigation areas.
#
# The obstacle tracker re-verifies that the physical obstacle is gone (the
# footprint is repeatedly observed clear / absent) before calling this -
# map_server trusts the caller's provenance check.
#
# Matching precedence:
#   1. obstacle_id != 0  -> exact session id of a SOURCE_TRACKER keepout.
#   2. centroid match    -> closest SOURCE_TRACKER keepout whose centroid lies
#                           within max_distance_m of `centroid`.
#
# Obstacles in navigation areas are never eligible, because auto-tracked
# obstacles can only ever be promoted into mowing areas.
geometry_msgs/Point centroid
float64 max_distance_m
uint32 obstacle_id
---
bool success
string message